---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import {services} from '@/data/services'
---
<BaseLayout title="Layanan Website & Solusi Digital — Carisite" description="Landing page, company profile, e-commerce, booking, dashboard, serta redesign website. Temukan layanan yang sesuai kebutuhan bisnis."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">What we can build</span><h1>Tujuan bisnis Anda.<br/><em>Bentuk digitalnya.</em></h1><p>Dari website pertama hingga pengalaman yang lebih kompleks. Kita mulai dengan kebutuhan, lalu menentukan teknologi dan lingkup yang tepat.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container services-list">{services.map(s=><article><span class="service-number">{s.number}</span><div><h2><a href={`/layanan/${s.id}`}>{s.title} ↗</a></h2><p>{s.description}</p><ul>{s.deliverables.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul></div><div class="service-side"><span>{s.price}</span><a class="button button-secondary" href={`/layanan/${s.id}`}>Kenali layanan →</a></div></article>)}</div></section><section class="section service-note"><div class="container"><h2>Belum tahu harus mulai dari mana?</h2><p>Pilih demo yang mendekati kebutuhan Anda, lalu ceritakan apa yang ingin dikembangkan.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/demo">Jelajahi demo ↗</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.services-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px 1fr 220px;gap:2rem;padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.service-number{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}.services-list h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 1rem}.services-list p{color:var(--muted);max-width:42rem;line-height:1.8}.services-list ul{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:1.5rem}.services-list li{font-size:.7rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:.5rem .8rem}.service-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:1.5rem;font-size:.8rem}.service-note{background:#e6ebde}.service-note h2{font-size:2.5rem;letter-spacing:-.05em}.service-note p{margin:1rem 0 2rem;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:800px){.services-list article{grid-template-columns:30px 1fr;gap:1rem}.service-side{grid-column:2}.service-note h2{font-size:2rem}}</style>
